:"周成","kind":"person","person_id":"anb_2wd_5ci_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-096","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p016","text":"申屠丞相嘉者，梁人，以材官蹶張從高帝擊項籍，遷為隊率。從擊黥布軍，為都尉。孝惠時，為淮陽守。孝文帝元年，舉故吏士二千石從高皇帝者，悉以為關內侯，食邑二十四人，而申屠嘉食邑五百戶。張蒼已為丞相，嘉遷為御史大夫。張蒼免相，孝文帝欲用皇后弟竇廣國為丞相，曰：「恐天下以吾私廣國。」廣國賢有行，故欲相之，念久之不可，而高帝時大臣又皆多死，餘見無可者，乃以御史大夫嘉為丞相，因故邑封為故安侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"申屠丞相嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"yph_dkb_w4w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"h8q_zyo_i2l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"jej_8s3_01z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"e4c_pkg_cq7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"srh_4ts_334","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"gum_f2l_s4k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"高皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"h8q_zyo_i2l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"申屠嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"yph_dkb_w4w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"張蒼","kind":"person","person_id":"796_nkw_0jz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m016-0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"yph_dkb_w4w","status":"contextual_provision